    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Class is used to initialise uniform properties of lower-dimensional sandbodies so that an application of the Brooks-Corey model will yied the correct input parameters for an element with a certain dip etc.</para>
<para>While the model needs &apos;total velocity&apos; as an input, all other properties are calculated locally. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
